From cef541c30bed858a6515a1121ba0b3056b94f57f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Joel Guittet <jguittet@witekio.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 10:33:57 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] twister: introduce pre-flash-script option

New pre-flash-script option symetric to post-flash-script.
The scripts order is the following: pre-script, pre-flash-script,
post-flash-script, post-script.

Signed-off-by: Joel Guittet <jguittet@witekio.com>
